  "implementationRules": [
    "Do not mark a company as verified solely because it appears in a directory.",
    "Store source URL, source country, retrieval time, licence/terms status, and verification status with every imported record.",
    "Prefer official APIs, downloadable open data, or explicitly licensed feeds. Do not scrape portals that prohibit automation.",
    "Where a country has no usable public registry/API, expose the official portal link and record access limitations instead of fabricating records.",
    "This is an initial seed, not full coverage of every country. Use the registry index sources to expand country-by-country and track each country's source coverage explicitly."
  ]
